    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 10,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "Michael. Dear, Michael. Nurse Michael. Dr. Clayton. Secret Hero. Keeper of the Hidden Sins. Of course it’s you. Who else could they send? Who else could be trusted? Smoke on the horizon -- hole in the bucket -- voices crying from Milwaukee to Manhattan, “Where’s our hero?”"
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 10,
        "line": 950,
        "text": "I mean, yes -- okay, yes -- elements of madness -- the speed of madness -- yes, the occasional, euphoric, pseudo-hallucinatory moments that, yes -- fine -- agreed -- distracting -- nostalgic -- all of that -- but that’s just the package -- the plate -- think of it as a tax --…"
      }
    },
